{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhulv-p0002","name":"光武帝","evidence":["zhulv-q-0c62f093d9133d8722ef"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhulv-m2-931fdc3517f272c6d98d","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhulv-q-0c62f093d9133d8722ef"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhulv-q-0c62f093d9133d8722ef","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-062d7325abf3106e2a61","layer":"pei","quote":"昔邓仲华初见光武：光武时受更始使，抚河北，行大司马事耳，未有帝王志也。禹劝之以复汉业，是禹开初议之端矣。子敬英爽有殊略，孤始与一语，便及大计；与禹相似，故比之。吕子衡忠笃亮直，性虽好奢，然以忧公为先，不足为损。避袁术，自归于兄；兄作大将，别领部曲，故忧兄事，乞为都督；办护修整，加之恪勤，与吴汉相类：故方之。皆有指趣，非孤私之也。’畯乃服","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-863d18fd3a14ad5facfd","start":100,"end":269,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
